     "background": "Francesca Yabraian is a first-generation American whose parents immigrated from Argentina. She has more than 20 years of experience in information technology and has held emergency-management roles with USDA and DHS, and she holds a degree in government and world affairs from the University of Tampa. Her campaign centers on housing costs, insurance and opposition to large AI data centers in Escambia County.",
